	(text "Strapping: \nBoot mode: Joint Download Boot \n(GPIO02 = 1, GPIO08 = 1, GPIO09 = 0)\n\nROM Printing Control: USB Serial\n(EFUSE_USB_PRINT_CHANNEL = 0, EFUSE_DIS_USB_SERIAL_JTAG = 0)\n(To enable printing: EFUSE_UART_PRINT_CONTROL = 2) \n(To disable printing: EFUSE_UART_PRINT_CONTROL = 1)\n"
